# Moogles in the Wild (otherAreas 102): the Moogle of Bastok Mines' Mog House (its script: xi.moghouse.moogleTrigger,
# the Moogle menu; moogleTrade: nothing). A Bastok char (nation 1) with fame level 7 (488) and a bed placed 61 seconds
# before the clock (bedPlacedTime 1799999939, a GM: no furniture step; the Noble's Bed's onFurniturePlaced writes it).
# The Moogle's Picnic! completed (a header line). AMK 1 off (ENABLE_AMK 0: its 30023 ties at the Moogle: #kinds). Into
# the Mog House: the zone's only line to itself (zmrg). Available: the mantle and the hat traded: no quest trade: the
# script's (nothing). The Moogle 30013 (0, 0, 0, 6, 0, Raptor Mantle, Wool Hat), option 0: questSeen 1, not begun.
# questSeen 0 (a GM): 30013 again at once (Progress: an Event would take the fallback turn, the menu first). Again:
# questSeen 1: no section: the menu. Out of the zone and back (questSeen is a local var): 30013, option 1: begun.
# Accepted, questSeen 1: nil: the menu. Out and back: Prog 0: 30014 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, the mantle, the hat), finished:
# questSeen 1; questSeen 0 (a GM): 30014 again at once, finished: questSeen 1: nil: the menu. The mantle and the hat
# traded: 30015, finished: both taken, Prog 1, Timer now + 60; the two again (GMs), traded: 30015 again at once. Out and
# back: Prog 1, the Timer ahead: nil: the menu. A day later (wait jst=1): 30016, finished: completed (Mog's Loving
# Master), the Mog Safe and Mog Safe 2 + 10. Available, then accepted again with Prog 1 (GMs: a status set back from
# completed keeps the completed bit, so available first): 30016 again at once, finished: completed again (the safes + 10
# again). Completed: no section: the menu.
lists BastokMines/Moogle/onTrigger BastokMines/Moogle/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/30013 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30014 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30015 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30016
char zone=BastokMines pos=116.9,-1.6,-72 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
setting ENABLE_AMK 0                    # AMK 1 (30023 at the Moogle) off: #kinds shows it
quest OtherAreas.TheMooglePicnic completed
fame Bastok 488
charvar Quest[4][102]bedPlacedTime 1799999939
item RaptorMantle
item WoolHat
login
zoneline BastokMines                    # into the Mog House (zmrg: the zone's only line to itself)
trade Moogle RaptorMantle x1 WoolHat x1 # available: no quest trade; the script's moogleTrade: nothing
trigger Moogle                          # available: 30013
finish option=0                         # questSeen 1; not begun
localvar Quest[4][102]questSeen 0       # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # 30013 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish option=0                         # questSeen 1; not begun
trigger Moogle                          # questSeen 1: section 1 off: the Moogle menu
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets             # out (the local questSeen cleared)
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines                    # back in
trigger Moogle                          # 30013
finish option=1                         # questSeen 1; begun
trigger Moogle                          # accepted, questSeen 1: nil; the menu
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
trigger Moogle                          # Prog 0: 30014
finish                                  # questSeen 1
localvar Quest[4][102]questSeen 0       # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # 30014 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish                                  # questSeen 1
trigger Moogle                          # questSeen 1: nil; the menu
trade Moogle RaptorMantle x1 WoolHat x1 # 30015
finish                                  # both taken; Prog 1; Timer now + 60
item RaptorMantle                       # a GM
item WoolHat                            # a GM
trade Moogle RaptorMantle x1 WoolHat x1 # 30015 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish                                  # both taken; Prog 1; Timer now + 60
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
trigger Moogle                          # Prog 1, Timer ahead: nil; the menu
wait jst=1                              # the Timer passed (GetSystemTime moves by days only)
trigger Moogle                          # Timer < now: 30016
finish                                  # completed; Mog's Loving Master; Mog Safe and Mog Safe 2 + 10
quest OtherAreas.MooglesInTheWild available # a GM: the completed bit cleared
quest OtherAreas.MooglesInTheWild accepted # a GM: accepted again
charvar Quest[4][102]Prog 1             # a GM (the Timer cleared: 0 < now)
trigger Moogle                          # 30016 again at once (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish                                  # completed again; the safes + 10 again
trigger Moogle                          # completed: no section (the last of the three); the menu
